    year: 2019
    doi: "10.1093/bioinformatics/btz459"
    notes: "The docking engine. Scripps Research Institute."
  - type: article
    title: >-
      AutoDockFR: Advances in Protein-Ligand Docking with Explicitly
      Specified Binding Site Flexibility
    authors:
